  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The Oriental Pearl TV Tower "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is familiar to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " all Shanghai citizens."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "东方明珠电视塔对所有上海市民来说都很熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Drivers should "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be very familiar with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the traffic signs and rules."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "司机应该通晓交通标志和规则。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "be/get familiar to/with 是常考词组，所以学生要知道：be/get familiar to 和 be/get familiar with 的用法区别。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "be/get familiar to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 对某人来说是熟悉的（主语是人或物）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "be/get familiar with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 熟悉某物或某人（主语是人）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Beijing "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is familiar to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " me. 北京对我来说很熟悉。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I’"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "m familiar with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Beijing. 我很熟悉北京。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
